	   <h2>Official description</h2> 
	      <div id="description-wrapper" class="description-wrapper">
        <div id="description-content" class="description-content" data-nosnippet>	 
            🔞 Access to content<br><br>✔ Live Live: Watch various broadcasts of Pop Star TV linked with Popcorn TV.<br>Free personal broadcasting, paid broadcasting, fan club broadcasting, VIP broadcasting, customized broadcasting, etc.<br>We provide various types of broadcasting content services.<br>✔ Real-time chat: BJ and viewers communicate in real time to make more interesting broadcasts.<br>✔ Item Gift: Gift items to your favorite BJ.<br>✔ Favorites: If you bookmark your favorite BJ broadcasts, you will be notified when the broadcast starts.<br>✔ PIP (Pop-up) function: You can use KakaoTalk or SNS while watching the broadcast.<br>✔ Various benefits: If you become a VIP of Popstar TV linked with popcorn, we will provide you with various benefits and items.<br><br>😆 Fill your daily life with fun!<br>Discover content on a variety of topics that will satisfy your daily routine and your ordinary and boring life on Pop Star TV.<br><br>❤️ This is Pop Star TV for you!<br>Watch a variety of live broadcasts for viewers, from everyday stories you can relate to, to the music you want to hear, a hot friend&#39;s room, and a mukbang.<br><br>🎧 Enjoy anytime, anywhere!<br>Commuting to work, in public transportation, in the car, during breaks, or on a picnic! Enjoy Pop Star TV anytime, anywhere.<br>You can communicate in real time with popcorn and chat in live broadcasts.<br><br>📣 Enjoy as a space for communication!<br>Communicate with many people on Pop Star TV.<br>You can chat with BJ and fans in the live broadcast.<br>You can also become a fan of someone and receive real-time news such as broadcast notifications and announcements.<br><br>Pop Star TV is a popcorn TV interworking platform, and it is a live video service that allows you to watch various types of real-time broadcasts such as talk broadcasting, mukbang, meeting room, friend room, and movie watching.<br>Enjoy various broadcasts of popular BJs anytime, anywhere.			        </div>
